-- **Search Bar**: shared by eligible Sevopedia categories (i.e. that have an item list, including Sevopedia Index); it allows to **search** for entries using the **keyboard**. The code is in [SevoPediaMain.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaMain.py). See [Sevopedia_reworks: search bar](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-01-added-a-search-bar-used-in-several-sevopedia-pages).
-- **Keyboard Navigation**: allows to **browse Sevopedia categories** using the keyboard in the list pages (e.g. In the Units Category: Axeman, Swordsman, Worker) or tree pages (e.g. Units Tree and Promotion Tree categories) using the **keyboard UP/DOWN arrow keys**. The code is in [SevoPediaMain.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaMain.py). See [Sevopedia_reworks: keyboard (UP/DOWN) navigation](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-02-added-keyboard-arrow-updown-navigation-support-used-in-several-sevopedia-pages).
+- Add **Search Bar**: shared by eligible Sevopedia categories (i.e. that have an item list, including Sevopedia Index); it allows to **search** for entries using the **keyboard**. (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5761+) **Special characters** (`()_/*+-=[]'#&~;,:!?.@\|<>`) are **supported** are supported for keyboard input with a **best-effort QWERTY/physical-key mapping** (e.g., `1` inputs `1`, and `Shift + 1` inputs `!`) because they are rarely used in Civ4 item names. An optional **clickable special-character visual keyboard** (with a `KEYS` **toggle link to hide it**) is also available. The code is in [SevoPediaMain.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaMain.py). See also [README.md (search bar)](/README.md#search-bar).
+- Add **Keyboard Navigation**: allows to **browse Sevopedia categories** using the keyboard in the list pages (e.g. In the Units Category: Axeman, Swordsman, Worker) or tree pages (e.g. Units Tree and Promotion Tree categories) using the **keyboard UP/DOWN arrow keys**. The code is in [SevoPediaMain.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaMain.py). See [Sevopedia_reworks: keyboard (UP/DOWN) navigation](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-02-added-keyboard-arrow-updown-navigation-support-used-in-several-sevopedia-pages).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5678+) **Fix empty pages** in Sevopedia **category opening flow:** opening a category now jumps **directly to the first real entry (if any)** instead of landing on a **blank header/spacer** row first; this makes **navigation easier** and avoids **needless and disruptive BACK/NEXT history pollution**. See [KI#119](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#119---fixed-sevopedia-category-opening-on-blank-placeholder-rows-item--1-and-polluting-backnext-history).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5729+) **Fix BACK/NEXT navigation history being lost on sevopedia exit** (e.g., to revisit AI Personality Panel pages during a game, or other categories previously visited): now **persists** during the entire **gaming session**. Added a **CLEAR** link to clear history. See [KI#125](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#125---fixed-base-advciv-issue-sevopedia-backnext-history-is-lost-on-exit).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5731+) Make **BACK**, **NEXT**, and **CLEAR** links **greyed** when they have **no effect** (e.g., clicking NEXT when current page is already last visited, or BACK on first page visited since last clear). This was especially confusing before the navigation history persistence fix, when after reopening sevopedia after last sevopedia exit, BACK and NEXT links would be there but produce no effect at all (previous history was lost) (links are greyed now making such absence of effect clear). Note: Legend link is not greyed but instead is hidden if a category has no legend link (if there is a legend it is always active, and if there is none is it never active, so no need for a grey link). See [KI#126](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues.md#126---fixed-sevopedia-footer-navigation-controls-looked-active-even-when-they-had-no-effect).

